WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.228 --> 00:00:01.165 line:10%
Men yon devinèt:

2
00:00:01.215 --> 00:00:03.744 line:10%
yon selil kè deja gen pwòp rezèv kalsyòm pa l —

3
00:00:03.794 --> 00:00:06.627 line:10%
kidonk poukisa li bezwen kalsyòm ki soti deyò jis pou l bat?

4
00:00:06.709 --> 00:00:08.351 line:10%
Repons lan se yon anplifikatè.

5
00:00:08.587 --> 00:00:12.336 line:10%
Yon potansyèl aksyon louvri kanal kalsyòm tip L nan manbràn nan.

6
00:00:12.395 --> 00:00:14.164 line:10%
Se sèlman kèk iyon ki antre.

7
00:00:14.329 --> 00:00:16.945 line:10%
Yo travèse espas la epi yo touche RyR2,

8
00:00:16.995 --> 00:00:19.687 line:10%
kanal liberasyon an sou retikulòm sakoplasmik la —

9
00:00:19.737 --> 00:00:22.155 line:10%
epi kanal tip L la fèmen dèyè yo.

10
00:00:22.624 --> 00:00:26.590 line:10%
RyR2 louvri, epi rezèv la vide nan sitozòl la.

11
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:30.370 line:10%
Kèk iyon antre; plizyè douzèn soti.

12
00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:34.012 line:10%
Sa se liberasyon kalsyòm ki pwovoke

13
00:00:34.378 --> 00:00:36.857 line:10%
pa kalsyòm — epi se sa ki

14
00:00:36.967 --> 00:00:38.936 line:10%
fè kè a kontrakte.

15
00:00:39.469 --> 00:00:41.814 line:10%
Pou kè a relaks, kalsyòm nan dwe ale.

16
00:00:41.995 --> 00:00:44.199 line:10%
SERCA ponpe pi fò ladan l tounen nan rezèv la,

17
00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:45.986 line:10%
epi li boule ATP pou fè sa.

18
00:00:46.061 --> 00:00:48.488 line:10%
Echanjè sodyòm-kalsyòm nan retire rès la —

19
00:00:48.538 --> 00:00:50.980 line:10%
twa sodyòm k ap antre pou chak yon kalsyòm k ap soti.

20
00:00:51.455 --> 00:00:52.768 line:10%
Kounye a pati ki itil la.

21
00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:55.298 line:10%
Menm kanal tip L sa a gen yon dezyèm travay.

22
00:00:55.461 --> 00:01:01.189 line:10%
Nan nod SA a ak nod AV a prèske pa gen kanal sodyòm rapid — se konsa la, kalsyòm pa deklanche batman an.

23
00:01:01.255 --> 00:01:02.323 line:10%
Se li ki pote l.

24
00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:06.397 line:10%
Nan fibrilasyon atriyal, atriyòm yo tire senk san fwa pa minit,

25
00:01:06.447 --> 00:01:09.746 line:10%
epi nod AV a se sèl pòt elektrik ki mennen nan vantrikil la.

26
00:01:10.219 --> 00:01:12.163 line:10%
Verapamil ak diltiazèm —

27
00:01:12.213 --> 00:01:15.262 line:10%
bloke kanal kalsyòm ki pa dihydropyridine yo —

28
00:01:15.312 --> 00:01:17.209 line:10%
bloke kanal tip L sa a.

29
00:01:17.627 --> 00:01:18.940 line:10%
Kondiksyon an ralanti,

30
00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:20.779 line:10%
peryòd refraktè a vin pi long,

31
00:01:20.829 --> 00:01:22.371 line:10%
mwens enpilsyon pase,

32
00:01:22.421 --> 00:01:24.339 line:10%
epi vitès vantrikilè a bese.

33
00:01:24.389 --> 00:01:27.929 line:10%
Men myosit k ap travay la sèvi ak menm kanal sa a pou fikse fòs li.

34
00:01:27.979 --> 00:01:30.089 line:10%
Bloke l la epi kontraksyon an vin fèb —

35
00:01:30.139 --> 00:01:32.739 line:10%
se poutèt sa medikaman sa yo danjere nan yon kè k ap febli,

36
00:01:32.789 --> 00:01:35.315 line:10%
ak nan fibrilasyon atriyal pre-eksite.

37
00:01:35.784 --> 00:01:38.716 line:10%
Li pa rete fibrilasyon an. Li jis fè pòt la vin pi jenn.

38
00:01:38.963 --> 00:01:40.450 line:10%
Yon dènye pyès.

39
00:01:40.787 --> 00:01:42.510 line:10%
SERCA pa travay lib.

40
00:01:42.947 --> 00:01:46.979 line:10%
Yon ti pwoteyin yo rele fosfolanban chita sou li

41
00:01:47.072 --> 00:01:49.439 line:10%
epi li kenbe l — se fren

42
00:01:49.518 --> 00:01:51.430 line:10%
repo relaksasyon an.

43
00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:54.274 line:10%
Fosforile fosfolanban epi li lage.

44
00:01:54.324 --> 00:01:55.867 line:10%
SERCA vin pi rapid,

45
00:01:55.917 --> 00:01:57.917 line:10%
kalsyòm nan retire pi vit,

46
00:01:57.968 --> 00:02:01.239 line:10%
epi kè a relaks pi vit. Sa se lisitwopi.

47
00:02:01.424 --> 00:02:03.531 line:10%
Epi yon sèl siyal fè tout sa.

48
00:02:03.581 --> 00:02:06.930 line:10%
Adrenalin touche reseptè bèta-1 la, cAMP monte,

49
00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.361 line:10%
epi PKA komanse travay —

50
00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:11.153 line:10%
sou twa sib. cAMP fè kouran

51
00:02:11.203 --> 00:02:12.891 line:10%
pacemaker la vin pi rèd,

52
00:02:12.993 --> 00:02:15.880 line:10%
kidonk kè a bat pi vit. PKA fosforile kanal

53
00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:18.542 line:10%
kalsyòm tip L la, kidonk plis kalsyòm

54
00:02:18.592 --> 00:02:21.007 line:10%
antre epi kontraksyon an vin pi fò.

55
00:02:21.057 --> 00:02:22.845 line:10%
Epi PKA fosforile fosfolanban,

56
00:02:22.895 --> 00:02:25.390 line:10%
kidonk kè a relaks pi vit.

57
00:02:25.461 --> 00:02:26.449 line:10%
Pi vit,

58
00:02:26.678 --> 00:02:27.669 line:10%
pi fò,

59
00:02:27.784 --> 00:02:30.511 line:10%
epi pi rapid pou relaks — yon sèl siyal.

60
00:02:31.039 --> 00:02:32.565 line:10%
Sistèm senpatik la

61
00:02:32.615 --> 00:02:34.920 line:10%
ogmante l. Verapamil bese l.

62
00:02:35.011 --> 00:02:37.797 line:10%
Epi lè twazyèm branch lan echwe epi kè a

63
00:02:37.847 --> 00:02:39.062 line:10%
pa ka relaks,

64
00:02:39.521 --> 00:02:43.561 line:10%
ranplisaj la echwe. Sa se disfonksyon dyastolik HFpEF la.

65
00:02:44.032 --> 00:02:45.414 line:10%
An rezime.

66
00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:47.845 line:10%
Kontrèman ak misk eskelèt, misk kè a bezwen

67
00:02:47.895 --> 00:02:50.011 line:10%
kalsyòm ki soti deyò selil la:

68
00:02:50.094 --> 00:02:55.239 line:10%
antre nan kanal tip L yo deklanche yon liberasyon ki pi gwo anpil soti nan retikolòm sakoplasmik la.

69
00:02:55.289 --> 00:02:58.595 line:10%
SERCA ak echanjè sodyòm-kalsyòm nan retire l ankò.

70
00:02:58.741 --> 00:03:02.123 line:10%
Menm kanal tip L sa a pote monte a nan nod AV a —

71
00:03:02.173 --> 00:03:06.935 line:10%
se poutèt sa verapamil ak diltiazèm ralanti vitès vantrikilè a nan fibrilasyon atriyal.

72
00:03:07.171 --> 00:03:09.899 line:10%
Epi paske kanal la fikse fòs kontraksyon an tou,

73
00:03:09.949 --> 00:03:12.035 line:10%
pri a se yon inotwopi negatif:

74
00:03:12.143 --> 00:03:15.214 line:10%
evite yo nan ensifizans kadyak ak fraksyon ejeksyon redwi,

75
00:03:15.264 --> 00:03:17.737 line:10%
ak nan fibrilasyon atriyal pre-eksite.

76
00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:19.590 line:10%
Epi yon dènye bagay.

77
00:03:19.862 --> 00:03:22.169 line:10%
Sistèm senpatik la

78
00:03:22.219 --> 00:03:24.292 line:10%
regle tou lè twa:

79
00:03:24.342 --> 00:03:26.510 line:10%
cAMP fè nod la vin pi rapid,

80
00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.378 line:10%
PKA louvri plis kanal tip L, epi PKA retire

81
00:03:29.455 --> 00:03:32.157 line:10%
fosfolanban sou SERCA. Pèdi dènye sa

82
00:03:32.207 --> 00:03:35.087 line:10%
a epi kè a pa ka relaks — sa se HFpEF.
